H('9. Data Quality, Monitoring and Reproducibility'); P('Great Expectations validation passed 36 configured checks with zero failures across 1,067,371 rows and 24 columns. Passing configured expectations does not prove every business-data issue has been detected.')
for x in ['Sales drift compared 517 reference observations with 222 current observations; dailySales was flagged as changed (KS p≈9.20×10⁻⁶). Distribution change does not itself prove model degradation.','The churn-score diagnostic split records by row order rather than a strictly chronological population, so it is not conclusive evidence of temporal drift.','Monitoring completed with caveats; those caveats are retained.','Local JSONL experiment records include parameters, metrics, artifact paths, sizes and SHA-256 hashes. Existing MLflow artifacts/database were retained as historical records.']: B(x)
