for x in ['Begin with the executive overview and check each metric’s evaluation window.','Use segmentation and churn outputs to support analyst review, not automatic treatment without checks.','Inspect demand-confidence flags before acting on inventory recommendations.','Retain dataset windows and model versions with exported decisions.']: B(x)
