H('15. Conclusion'); P('RetailPulse demonstrates a multi-stage retail analytics workflow across more than one million historical transaction rows. Completed components include cleaning, configured quality validation, EDA, RFM segmentation with PCA and DBSCAN, forecast baselines, churn modelling with temporal evaluation and SHAP, historical-demand inventory review, monitoring diagnostics, and a multi-page dashboard.'); P('Prophet is the best current forecast baseline, with 27.50% MAPE on non-zero holdout days and 37.02% WAPE. The Optuna-tuned temporal churn model achieved ROC-AUC 0.7695 and precision@top 20% of 0.7555 at the evaluated cutoff. Forecast and churn targets are not all met. Inventory impact remains unmeasured because operational data and intervention outcomes are missing.'); P('The appropriate conclusion is an analytical prototype with transparent limitations, not a fully deployed production platform or a proven source of quantified business improvement.','Callout'); H2('Project artifacts')
